sequenceDiagram
    actor University
    participant UI as Issuer Dashboard
    participant API as Backend / API
    participant Registry as IssuerRegistry
    participant Contract as CredentialAnchor
    actor Graduate
    actor Employer as Employer / Verifier

    University->>UI: Sign in and select graduate record
    UI->>API: Submit approved credential data
    API->>API: Create credential hash (demo data only)
    API->>Registry: Check university active status
    Registry-->>API: Active / inactive
    API->>Contract: addDiploma(diplomaId, diplomaHash)
    Contract-->>API: Transaction confirmed
    API-->>Graduate: Shareable credential reference

    Graduate->>Employer: Share credential and proof
    Employer->>API: Submit diplomaId and presented hash
    API->>Contract: checkDiploma(diplomaId, presentedHash)
    Contract-->>API: true / false
    API-->>Employer: Verification result

    University->>Contract: revokeDiploma(diplomaId)
    Contract-->>University: Revocation confirmed
    Employer->>Contract: Check same credential again
    Contract-->>Employer: false (revoked)
